        179.1833953857422
      ],
      "text": "A total of 29 studies with 13 852 specimens provided data for evaluating TB detection from the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.971713066101074,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        181.53839111328125,
        526.9616088867188,
        194.6833953857422
      ],
      "text": "five index tests ( ). Of these 29 studies, 12 were conducted on the Abbott RealTi e  Fig. 2.1.2.1 m",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
