    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        252.04241943359375,
        526.9810791015625,
        265.18743896484375
      ],
      "text": "Of the 29 studies, 16 (55%) had high or unclear risk of bias because they tested specimens",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        267.54241943359375,
        527.0579833984375,
        280.68743896484375
      ],
      "text": "before inclusion in the study, used convenience sampling or did not report the method of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.04241943359375,
        526.9624633789062,
        296.18743896484375
      ],
      "text": "participant selection. Thus, the evidence was downgraded one level for risk of bias. Overall,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        298.54241943359375,
        467.0906982421875,
        311.68743896484375
      ],
      "text": "the certainty of the evidence was moderate for sensitivity and high for specificity.",
